{"ID":"20250328192851-e4fwkgq","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250328192851-e4fwkgq","title":"CPPS1L5——反码和补码","type":"doc","updated":"20250424112052"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328192851-7n6y54t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250328192851-7n6y54t","updated":"20250424111650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原码"}]},{"ID":"20250424111414-ozuss6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424111414-ozuss6d","updated":"20250424111441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原码是有符号整数的最简单表示方法，使用一个符号位和数值位来表示一个整数\n最高位（最左侧的位）是符号位："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 表示正数，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 表示负数，其余位表示数值的绝对值\n比如（一个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"short"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 2个字节 16位）："}]},{"ID":"20250424111442-7wkz5tx","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250424111442-7wkz5tx","updated":"20250424111650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"5  = 0000 0000 0000 0101\n-5 = 1000 0000 0000 0101\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250424111444-m48v01p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424111444-m48v01p","updated":"20250424111508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果在计算机中正负数都用原码表示，会出现两个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的问题，因此计算机中存储整数时并不会采用原码来存储"}]},{"ID":"20250424111515-yccjh5d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250424111515-yccjh5d","updated":"20250424111857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反码"}]},{"ID":"20250424111530-yb8prfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424111530-yb8prfj","updated":"20250424111534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反码是一种对负数进行编码的方法，它是对原码的一种改进\n反码算是一个中间码，一般不会直接使用"}]},{"ID":"20250424111540-5awkas1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424111540-5awkas1","updated":"20250424111606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假设原码为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"正数的反码和原码相同"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" = "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"负数的反码是对它的原码非符号位取反"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" = "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"~A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​（符号位不变）"}]},{"ID":"20250424111622-ga9rx3s","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250424111622-ga9rx3s","updated":"20250424111809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"           原码                     反码         \n5  = 0000 0000 0000 0101     0000 0000 0000 0101\n-5 = 1000 0000 0000 0101     1111 1111 1111 1010\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250424111607-xfqajb8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250424111607-xfqajb8","updated":"20250424111857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补码"}]},{"ID":"20250424111739-od6f6et","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424111739-od6f6et","updated":"20250424111830"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补码是现代计算机系统中最常用的负数表示法，解决了两个零的问题\n假设原码为 A 反码为 B\n正数的补码和原码相同 = A\n负数的补码是在它的反码基础上加 1 = B + 1"}]},{"ID":"20250424111747-k4rqmiy","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250424111747-k4rqmiy","updated":"20250424111750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"           原码                     反码                      补码\n5  = 0000 0000 0000 0101     0000 0000 0000 0101      0000 0000 0000 0101\n-5 = 1000 0000 0000 0101     1111 1111 1111 1010      1111 1111 1111 1011\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250424111743-9rn9pj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424111743-9rn9pj8","updated":"20250424111815"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"程序中所有的整数都是用补码规则表示的 2 进制存储在内存中的"}]},{"ID":"20250424111857-0i7j59n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250424111857-0i7j59n","updated":"20250424112052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么要用补码表示负数"}]},{"ID":"20250424111906-n1uxyf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424111906-n1uxyf7","updated":"20250424111912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主要原因："}]},{"ID":"20250424111912-e50kzsr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250424111912-e50kzsr","updated":"20250424111912"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424111912-cx127cu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250424111912-cx127cu","updated":"20250424111912"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424111912-dqcpub4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424111912-dqcpub4","updated":"20250424111912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解决两个零的问题\n"}]},{"ID":"20250424111914-sh5xt52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424111914-sh5xt52","updated":"20250424112004"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在原码和反码表示法中,存在两个零的情况 即："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"+0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n而在补码表示法中，只有一个零 就是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"0000 0000 0000 0000"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n而补码 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"1000 0000 0000 0000"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 代表的数是\n反码："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"1000 0000 0000 0000 - 1 = 0111 1111 1111 1111"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​\n原码："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"1000 0000 0000 0000"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 它是一个非常特殊的数 为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-32768"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 为 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"short"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的最小值"}]}]},{"ID":"20250424111912-2aa5iq4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250424111912-2aa5iq4","updated":"20250424111912"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250424111912-k6mrusc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424111912-k6mrusc","updated":"20250424111912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"统一加减法运算\n"}]},{"ID":"20250424112007-trp4pn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424112007-trp4pn5","updated":"20250424112013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只需做二进制加法（考虑进位），即使负数的加法也适用\n加法和减法可以通过相同的加法电路来完成，无需区分是正数加正数、正数加负数，还是负数减正数等情况\n"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250424112013-t4b819n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424112013-t4b819n","updated":"20250424112014"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250424112048-rzbuef2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250424112048-rzbuef2","updated":"20250424112052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所有有符号整数的二进制表示都是补码（正数的补码和原码相同，负数的补码是它的反码 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"+1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​）\n这不仅简化了硬件电路的设计和实现，也大大提高了数值运算的效率和一致性\n补码表示法是计算机系统中表示和处理有符号整数的标准方法"}]}]}